  m_text: "G\xF6zlem 04: Muhaf\u0131z hareket izini takip ediyor. Bak\u0131m ekibi
    kendi ge\xE7mi\u015Flerini yem ve operat\xF6r olarak kullan\u0131p tahliye hatt\u0131n\u0131
    a\xE7m\u0131\u015F. \xC7\u0131k\u0131\u015F, ge\xE7mi\u015Fini silmekten de\u011Fil
